# Runtime output, never committed.
#
# `pa.py` writes a pre-change snapshot of a flow here before it patches, so a
# rollback has something to restore from. Those files are a verbatim dump of a
# live tenant: environment and flow GUIDs, connection references, SharePoint
# site URLs, and whatever the flow's own actions embed.
#
# One was committed and pushed to this PUBLIC repo before anyone noticed --
# found by a review, not by a person reading the diff, because a 51KB JSON blob
# in a 59-file changeset is exactly what nobody opens. The snapshot directory is
# ignored wholesale rather than per-file so the next one cannot arrive the same
# way.
scripts/pa-snapshots/
